@startuml RSAPrivateKey
!include ../../style.puml

title RSAPrivateKey Struct

class RSAPrivateKey <<struct>> {
    + p: PrimeInteger
    + q: PrimeInteger
}

note right of RSAPrivateKey
  **RSAPrivateKey Struct**
  
  Contains the prime factors P and Q
  where P × Q = N (RSA modulus).
  
  Enables factorization shortcut
  for timelock puzzle solving.
end note

note bottom of RSAPrivateKey
  **Prime Factorization**
  
  Knowledge of P and Q allows
  immediate solution of timelock
  puzzle without computational delay.
end note

@enduml